d here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025 the county&rsquo;s middle value got 43% of normal in November to December and 59% in September to October. In 2026 so far, May to June came in at 164% of normal on the county&rsquo;s middle value. Grid 13661 had its driest year in 1954 at 64%.</p>"}
